          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PRO unlocks Brand Kit watermarks, multi-size one-pass export, and automation (the vitrine CLI, Shortcuts, and folder batch). The free tier loses nothing." : {
      "comment" : "What's New highlight for version 0.9.0.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
